# SwarmGate: Attention Governor & Escalation Hypervisor

SwarmGate is Stage 3 of the Swarm Suite Agent Hypervisor stack. It sits between deterministic verification (`swarmproof`) and state commitment (`swarmlock`), calculating the Escalation Index ($E$) to protect human operator attention while strictly gating high-blast-radius mutations.
